# The ann-benchmarks corpora (hundreds of megabytes, downloaded from
# ann-benchmarks.com), the result files a run writes, and the throwaway
# virtualenv `bench/ann/requirements.txt` describes. The adapter itself —
# module.py, run.py, config.yml, Dockerfile — is committed.
bench/ann/data/
bench/ann/results/
bench/ann/.venv/
.DS_Store

