# npm dependencies for the browser and edge smoke tests
node_modules/
.claude/worktrees/

# Working notes that are not part of the product.
#
# `PLAN.md` is the internal roadmap — phases, ticket numbers, what is being
# attempted next and why. Its *durable* half, the architecture decisions the
# source comments cite by number, lives in `docs/architecture.md` and is
# public. `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude/` are AI-agent instructions and scratch
# worktrees, which describe how this repository is worked on rather than what
# it is.
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.ci-logs/
__pycache__/
